  "question": "Where is gallery located inside a 140 kilometers radius on the way from South University, Austin, Round Rock, TX to Five Wells Roping Rodeo Arena, TX?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-97.689962 30.479356)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-97.402227 30.995182)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-97.689962 30.479356)',4326)::geography, 140000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-97.689962 30.479356)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
